### Tremor Court Hearing - Burden, Realm Evolution
Prerequisite: Tremor-Listening Palm, CL 10+
While touching a solid or earthen surface, use an Action to listen through a number of connected Foundation Spaces you created.
Until the start of your next turn, you know the location of creatures touching those spaces, and you can tell whether each creature is:
moving quickly;
standing still;
Prone;
carrying a heavy load;
burrowing;
flying but within 5 feet of the surface;
concentrating on a spell, sphere talent, or supernatural technique that produces physical vibration.
This does not reveal private thoughts, exact identity, or illusions that do not interact with weight or contact.
